 "Which application documents must be submitted as originals?",
 ["The application form and any other documents designated by the local authority","The company registration certificate and the responsible person identity document","The commissioned inspection contract and the inspector training certificates","The exhaust analyzer certificate and the lane staffing proof documents"],
