 "How must a change to the licence particulars be handled before it takes place?",
 ["It must be reported in writing and approved in advance by the local competent authority","It may be reported to the central authority for record within 30 days after the change","A new commissioned inspection contract must be obtained from the highway agency first","It may be made directly and explained when the licence renewal is next applied for"],
